Windows 365 (W365) Overview

Windows 365 is a cloud-based Software as a Service (SaaS) that automatically creates a new type of Windows virtual machine, known as Cloud PCs, for end users.

Accessibility: Allows users to access Windows 10 or 11 from various devices (Windows, macOS, iOS, and Android).

Scalability: Offers various solutions to support organizations of all sizes with multiple deployment options tailored to specific roles and needs.

