The Cloud PC Concept

Definition: A highly available, optimized, and scalable VM providing a rich Windows desktop experience.

Personalization: Users have a 1:1 relationship with their Cloud PC; it acts as their personal computer in the cloud.

Automation: Created automatically when a user in an appropriate Microsoft Entra group is assigned a license.

Continuity: Maintains a consistent device state; users can resume work exactly where they left off without loss of data or settings.
Technical Skills	Requires detailed VDI config knowledge.	Little to no VDI experience required.
User Self-Service	Not supported.	Restart, Troubleshoot, Restore via Web/App.

